{"id":103159798148004,"name":"[NEW] POPPING IN 🐟","desc":"🌿 **Empang Indo - Fish Farming Simulator** 🐟\n\nWelcome to **Empang Indo!** Build your own angler and become the best fish breeder.\n\n🐟 **Cultivator of various types of fish**\nFrom cheap fish like **Lele and Nila**, to rare fish like **Betutu, Piranha and Arowana**.\n\n\n🐟 **Starting from seed**\nBuy fish seedlings, put them in the pond, wait until big, then harvest to get money.\n\n💰 **Develop your handle**\nUpgrade ponds, unlock new fish, and upgrade your level to get more expensive fish.\n\n🌧 **Rare fish & special event**\nSome fish only appear in certain conditions like when it rains!\n\n⭐ **Level up and become a master**\nThe higher your level, the more types of fish you can keep.\n\nBuild the biggest yam and become the **Yam King in Indo Yam!** 🐟\n","path":"/game/103159798148004-popping-in","slug":"103159798148004-popping-in","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e1452aadda45e06ccb8d6cc06d747a3bb8cb5c76be9dafbc8c4984c478d8e70a.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-351227a0fef36ea3a41fca41e9fa60f2/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":0,"visitor":74115,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-14T21:40:53.972Z","creator":{"name":"Paklek","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"totalPages":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"69b5d5e5942b0cf7aab5c14f","title":"empang indo","game":{"_id":"69b5d5e5942b0cf7aab5c14a","gameId":103159798148004,"name":"[NEW] POPPING IN 🐟","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/33087b8001517ecd1549950e8eeb7bce2bb485cb6d940a4aac48e883be1482a2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-bf91ee651369a877c21aa8ec48adc976-041c971d2e38.png"},"slug":"103159798148004-popping-in","path":"/game/103159798148004-popping-in","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/33087b8001517ecd1549950e8eeb7bce2bb485cb6d940a4aac48e883be1482a2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-bf91ee651369a877c21aa